	<Name><![CDATA[USA States]]></Name>
	<Description><![CDATA[This model demonstrates calling a public API to dynamically generate agents, each representing a U.S. state with population size data for the specified year provided in the model's input. It was built as part of AnyLogic's ChatGPT webinar, in the section about prompt engineering.]]></Description>
	<EngineVersion>6</EngineVersion>
